                "operation": "Load partsupp_ps_partkey_grouped index. For each qualifying partkey, lookup (start, count) in grouped index. For each partsupp row in [start, start+count), load ps_suppkey, check europe_supplier_bitset. If EUROPE supplier, load ps_supplycost and track MIN. Store min_cost per qualifying part, and the suppkey that achieved it.",
                "parallel_over": "qualifying_partkeys (morsel-driven)",
